ttlements, later incorporating additional towns including Ithome according to Strabo [1] [2]. The city formed part of a strategic quadrangle with Tricca, Pelinnaeum, and Gomphi, and its location is confirmed by Julius Caesar''s march from Gomphi to Pharsalus in 48 BC during the Civil War [1] [2] [3] [4].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246129", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''3000 - 1500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246130", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-3000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346372", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:346373", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s001: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:413989", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07d_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:413990", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07d_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start None -> ''-500''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('186eeb54-e6a0-4370-87c6-fbcaae023a33'::uuid, 'mystery', '5', '6', 'card-stats-2026-11-07d-rollback:186eeb54-e6a0-4370-87c6-fbcaae023a33:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07d: mystery ''6'' restored on Broadsands Chambered Tomb', 'cd277a8c6526fa11fc70f496fa402b7d', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 5 from (''Cairn'', ''4500 - 3000 BC'') is shared by 27 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export ddb8b67997033964 (2026-11-07 15:22:34.233295+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 118 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59556 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-07c''s own export (2026-11-07 13:29:26.934212+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:82064", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2050:chunk-0001: description ''Neolithic passage grave overlooking Broadsands Beach in Torbay, Devon, and the only known surviving example of its type in the county. Excavated by Ralegh Radford in 1958, the tomb comprises an irregular polygonal chamber measuring 3.35 m by 2.1 m set within a stone cairn. Inside were the fragmentary remains of two adults and a child alongside Neolithic pottery sherds. The tomb was disturbed in the medieval period when it was incorporated into a parish boundary hedge bank. Listed as a Scheduled Monument since 1957.'' -> ''The Broadsands Chambered Tomb is a Neolithic burial chamber located on a slope overlooking Broadsands Beach in Torbay in Devon [1]. The tomb is currently a part of a hedge bank, situated on hilly farmland between Broadsands Beach and the tracks of the Dartmouth Steam Railway [1]. The tomb comprises a megalithic chamber and has a single entrance passageway [1]. It was originally set within a cairn, part of which survives to the present day [1]. During excavations it was found to contain the fragmentary remains of two adults and a child along with pottery shards from the Neolithic era [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94358", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94359", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:143518", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/186eeb54/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/186eeb54/Neolithic Chamber Tomb at Broadsands - geograph.org.uk - 2061514.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235484", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235485", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:331456", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-006-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/186eeb54/Neolithic Chamber Tomb at Broadsands - geograph.org.uk - 2061514.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/186eeb54/Neolithic Chamber Tomb at Broadsands - geograph.org.uk - 2061841.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
