d along with pottery shards from the Neolithic era [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94358", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94359", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:143518", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/186eeb54/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/186eeb54/Neolithic Chamber Tomb at Broadsands - geograph.org.uk - 2061514.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235484", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235485", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:331456", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-006-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/186eeb54/Neolithic Chamber Tomb at Broadsands - geograph.org.uk - 2061514.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/186eeb54/Neolithic Chamber Tomb at Broadsands - geograph.org.uk - 2061841.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
