n the fragmentary remains of two adults and a child along with pottery shards from the Neolithic era [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94358", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94359", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:143518", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/186eeb54/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/186eeb54/Neolithic Chamber Tomb at Broadsands - geograph.org.uk - 2061514.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235484", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:235485", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s002: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:331456", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-06-006-001: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/186eeb54/Neolithic Chamber Tomb at Broadsands - geograph.org.uk - 2061514.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/186eeb54/Neolithic Chamber Tomb at Broadsands - geograph.org.uk - 2061841.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('18c1c7b1-c7b0-415d-b390-f862c4924120'::uuid, 'mystery', '7', '6', 'card-stats-2026-11-07d-rollback:18c1c7b1-c7b0-415d-b390-f862c4924120:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07d: mystery ''6'' restored on Devil''s Lapful', '7b6d4923925d0a0e2ec206756ada6bce', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 7 from (''Cairn'', ''Undated'') is shared by 6 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export ddb8b67997033964 (2026-11-07 15:22:34.233295+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 118 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59556 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-07c''s own export (2026-11-07 13:29:26.934212+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:29286", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase3:batch-0266:chunk-0001: period_start ''-4500'' -> ''-3400''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:35672", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-25_mechanical-journal-reversal-3: period_start ''-3400'' -> ''-4500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:82086", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2051:chunk-0001: description \"Devil''s Lapful is a Neolithic long cairn in Kielder Forest, Northumberland, dating to approximately 3400-2400 BC. One of few surviving long cairns in Northumberland, it measures 60 by 14 metres and stands 2 metres high, constructed of rounded boulders with stone slabs and smaller stones at the edges. Oriented north-northeast to south-southwest on a hillside slope, the cairn likely served as a communal burial site for a local community over several generations. First examined in the 1930s by Newbigin with inconclusive results, the site shows evidence of later quarrying for a nearby sheep fold. It has been designated a scheduled monument.\" -> \"Devil''s Lapful is an archaeological site in Northumberland in Kielder Forest about 0.8 miles south-east of Kielder [1]. The site, a Neolithic long cairn, is a scheduled monument [1]. The cairn is one of few surviving long cairns in Northumberland [1]. It is on the south-west slope of a hill, and is orientated north-north-east to south-south-west [1]. It is constructed of rounded boulders with some stone slabs, and with smaller stones at the edges; it measures 60 by 14 metres, and is 2 metres high [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94369", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:94370", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s003: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246465", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s003: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246466", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s003: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:384998", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:384999", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
