 No. Nº 751/INC on July 27, 2001  [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95342", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:95343", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s004: period_start ''1'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:145363", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-006: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/280f2b7d/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/280f2b7d/Pumacocha Archaeological site - bath.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246943", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246944", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''1''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:308615", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-003: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/280f2b7d/Pumacocha Archaeological site - bath.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/280f2b7d/Pumacocha_Archaeological_site_-_doorway.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347235", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_name ''1 - 500 AD'' -> ''1000 - 1500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:347236", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s002: period_start ''1'' -> ''1438''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('29446177-8f7d-4e23-9a9c-6c9ba2959472'::uuid, 'mystery', '5', '6', 'card-stats-2026-11-07d-rollback:29446177-8f7d-4e23-9a9c-6c9ba2959472:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07d: mystery ''6'' restored on Rubha an Dùnain Passage Grave', '34c71106c5b0ead2b79a55ab5279bbe1', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 5 from (''Cairn'', ''4500 - 3000 BC'') is shared by 27 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export ddb8b67997033964 (2026-11-07 15:22:34.233295+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 118 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59556 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-07c''s own export (2026-11-07 13:29:26.934212+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:82466", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-2062:chunk-0001: description ''Rubha an Dunain is an uninhabited peninsula south of the Cuillin hills on the Isle of Skye, Scotland, containing archaeological sites spanning 8,000 years of continuous human occupation. Key features include a Neolithic chambered cairn and passage grave constructed with alternating panels of upright slabs, excavated in 1932 and yielding pottery and flint tools. An Iron Age dun with massive fortification walls guards the seaward approach. A unique tidal canal connecting Loch na h-Airde to the sea once served as a sheltered galley mooring, likely used by Clan MacAskill from the 12th century. Designated a historic monument of national importance by Historic Environment Scotland in 2017.'' -> ''Rubha an Dùnain or Rubh\\'' an Dùnain is an uninhabited peninsula to the south of the Cuillin hills on the Isle of Skye in Scotland [1]. It contains unique archaeological sites which in 2017 were designated as a historic monument of national importance by Historic Environment Scotland [1]. This headland rises to over 30 metres above sea level [1]. The peninsula contains archaeological sites dating from the Mesolithic period onwards [1]. Its name means \"point of the little fort\" [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114880", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114881", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: period_start ''-3000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114882", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> ''Cairn''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:114883", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s002: source_url ''https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rubha_an_D%C3%B9nain'' -> ''https://her.highland.gov.uk/Monument/MHG4901''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246953", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:246954", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385052", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385053", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399619", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:399620", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start None -> ''-4500''"}]'::jsonb),
