 minor excavation in 1939, fragments of Iron Age pottery, as well as sling-stones and bones, were found in a pit near the western entrance [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96483", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96484", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_start ''-1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:146368", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-007: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3415ea00/hero.webp'' -> \"/data/images/wiki/3415ea00/Flower''s Barrow hill fort (1969).webp\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247399", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247400", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''-800''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:309435", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-004: thumbnail_url \"/data/images/wiki/3415ea00/Flower''s Barrow hill fort (1969).webp\" -> ''/data/images/wiki/3415ea00/Worbarrow_bay_and_Flowers_barrow.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385091", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385092", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-800'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:413991", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07d_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:413992", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07d_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start None -> ''-1500''"}]'::jsonb),
