southeast end to the northwest end, and it is 1 metre high [1]. The chamber was badly restored in 1866 when eight men re-erected the stones, arranging them radially \"rather like the slices of a cake\" and supporting a large capstone [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97268", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:97269", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s006: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:147139", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-008: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/3bcff938/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/3bcff938/Helstone with surrounding farmland.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247799", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:247800", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s006: period_start None -> ''-4000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385109", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:385110", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start ''-4000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
