ted in church councils [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98123", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:98124", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s007: period_start ''-1500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:148674", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-010: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/49d6b7c5/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/49d6b7c5/The_Theater_of_Alabanda_(49222297773).webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:237547", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s004: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:237548", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s004: period_start None -> ''-400''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:310393", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-005: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/49d6b7c5/The_Theater_of_Alabanda_(49222297773).webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/49d6b7c5/Alabanda_Bouleuterion.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348201", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:348202", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s003: period_start ''-400'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:413997", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07d_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:413998", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07d_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start None -> ''-500''"}]'::jsonb),
