n Naissus and Serdica [1]. The patron saint of Romania, Nicetas of Remesiana, was a 4th-century bishop at Remesiana [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99951", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:99952", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:150357", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/5b27b64f/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/5b27b64f/BelaPalankaIskopine.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:304095", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04e_period-label-undated: period_name None -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:414009", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07d_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:414010", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07d_mechanical-period-fix-s001: period_start None -> ''1''"}]'::jsonb),
