e of Yarso has been dated to the years between 3500 and 2500 BC [1]. The burial monument can be seen as a large grass-covered mound with a concrete roof [1]. The tomb is a type of Orkney–Cromarty stalled chambered cairn, similar to Midhowe and Blackhammer, also located on Rousay [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:100877", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s010: period_name ''4500 - 3000 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:100878", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s010: period_start ''-4500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:151783", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-014: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/6972abd9/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/6972abd9/Rousay Knowe of Yarso Chambered Cairn 01.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:238585", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s005: period_name None -> ''4500 - 3000 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:238586", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s005: period_start None -> ''-3500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:312129", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-007: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/6972abd9/Rousay Knowe of Yarso Chambered Cairn 01.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/6972abd9/Knowe_of_Yarso,_Neolithic_chambered_cairn,_Rousay,_Orkney.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
