f chambered cairn [1]. Radiocarbon dating has placed its construction to around 3400 BC [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:158450", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-023: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Chambered_Cairn_and_Farm_House_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1075905.jpg/400px-Chambered_Cairn_and_Farm_House_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1075905.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/aba085f1/hero.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
