8 metres in diameter by 3.7 metres high [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:160675", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-026: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/bc4228ff/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/bc4228ff/Grey Cairns of Camster - Camster Round entrance.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:316573", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-012: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/bc4228ff/Grey Cairns of Camster - Camster Round entrance.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/bc4228ff/A_Neolithic_burial_long_cairn_at_Camster.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
