and well preserved, and engravings of great antiquity occur [1]. Engravings of both figurative and abstract styles are found throughout Quinkan country [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108731", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:108732", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s019: period_start ''-25000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:162111", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-028: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ef/Quinkan5.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c9a49774/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253233", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_name None -> ''< 4500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:253234", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04_fields-wd3-s018: period_start None -> ''-10000''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:317448", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-013: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/c9a49774/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/c9a49774/Quinkan5.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387386", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''< 4500 BC'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:387387", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_start ''-10000'' -> None"}]'::jsonb),
