ambo District [1]. It is situated between the rivers Patakancha and Willkanuta, northeast of the town Ollantaytambo [1]. The name \"Pinkuylluna\" derives from the Pinkuyllu, a type of flute found throughout the Andes [1]. It is unknown if literal Pinkuyllu were played at the site, as the name may be a reference to the prominent local mountain winds [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109717", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_name ''1000 - 1500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109718", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_start ''1000'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:163766", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-030: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/Ollantaytambo_granaries_Stevage.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/d9960a60/Pinkuylluna_interior.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:243777", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''1000 - 1500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:243778", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''1401''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:318357", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-014: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/d9960a60/Pinkuylluna_interior.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/d9960a60/Ollantaytambo_granaries_Stevage.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
    ('da99f5e5-6c0b-4700-a1d1-5f452f06538f'::uuid, 'mystery', '9', '10', 'card-stats-2026-11-07d-rollback:da99f5e5-6c0b-4700-a1d1-5f452f06538f:mystery', 'rollback of card-stats-2026-11-07d: mystery ''10'' restored on Beltany Stone Circle', '60146471ae0b703f7b539ede708278aa', '[{"source": "api/cardgame/generator.py:site_card_stats", "url": "api/cardgame/generator.py", "quote": "mystery = 9 from (''Stone circle'', ''1500 - 500 BC'') is shared by 2 curated site(s)"}, {"source": "production export ddb8b67997033964 (2026-11-07 15:22:34.233295+00)", "url": "remediation_change_log + unified_sites + card_stats (read-only)", "quote": "counterfactual: 118 journalled input value(s) put back reproduce the stored card_stats in all 59556 cells (basis: wave 2026-11-07c''s own export (2026-11-07 13:29:26.934212+00))"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:45321", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "phase4:p4-0109:chunk-0001: description ''Beltany Stone Circle is a Bronze Age stone circle in County Donegal, Ireland, dating to circa 2100–700 BC. Located south of Raphoe, it may have originated as a sacred Neolithic site with possible early passage tomb connections. The circle overlooks the destroyed passage tomb complex at Kilmonaster and is dominated by Croghan Hill, whose summit bears an unexcavated Neolithic mound likely also a passage tomb [1]. The site is a state-owned National Monument in the care of the Office of Public Works [2].'' -> ''The Beltany stone circle is a Bronze Age stone circle just south of Raphoe town in County Donegal [1]. It dates from around 2100-700 BC [1]. Beltany is 145 feet across and has 64 stones (originally there would have been at least 80 stones) of varying height and width enclosing an earthen platform [1]. The stones are large with some more than 6 feet in height [1]. The centre is greatly disturbed and most likely was the result of digging by locals in the 1700s for available loose stones to build farmsteads and field boundaries [1]. The enigmatic Stone Circle is situated on the summit of Tops Hill [1]. Several stones are cupmarked [1]. A single ‘outlier’ stone about 2 metres high stands to the southeast of the circle [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109735", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_name ''3000 - 1500 BC'' -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109736", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_start ''-3000'' -> ''-1400''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:163811", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-030: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/da99f5e5/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/da99f5e5/01. Beltany Stone Circle, Co. Donegal.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:318378", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "import-hero-2026-10-05-002-014: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/da99f5e5/01. Beltany Stone Circle, Co. Donegal.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/da99f5e5/Beltany_Stone_Circle_P1180130.webp''"}]'::jsonb),
