. The Danubian limes was one of the most turbulent regions in the European part of the Roman Empire and, during more than 400 years of Roman rule, Pannonia was one of its most important provinces, especially after the abandonment of Dacia Traiana in 271 AD, because from that point on, the pressure of migrating peoples on this section of the limes increased still further [1]. The majority of the occupying forces were stationed in camps, small forts, watchtowers, burgi and fortified bridgeheads that were built at regular intervals along the riverbank [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109768", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:109769", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s020: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:163844", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-030: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Limes4.png/400px-Limes4.png'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/db85cd62/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:243790", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s010: period_name None -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:243791", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s010: period_start None -> ''-31''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353722", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> ''Undated''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:353723", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-17a_fields-wd5-s009: period_start ''-31'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401893", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-11-07c_mechanical-period-fix-s004: period_name ''Undated'' -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:401894", "url": "remediation_change_lo